{
  "name": "Reactivation",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🔁 Reactivation\n\nCorre todos los días a las 9am. Busca clientes que no compran hace 90+ días y les manda una campaña para que vuelvan.\n\n**Flujo:**\n1. Registra que el cron corrió hoy (aunque no encuentre a nadie)\n2. Busca en Supabase clientes inactivos (90+ días sin comprar, con `marketing_opt_in = true`, que no recibieron ya la campaña)\n3. Actualiza sus datos en Brevo\n4. Envía la campaña de reactivación\n5. Marca `reactivation_sent_at` en Supabase (para que nunca la reciban 2 veces)\n6. Marca `FUNNEL_STAGE = winback_sent` en Brevo — así Post-Purchase puede detectar si esta persona vuelve a comprar\n\nTodos los eventos se reportan a **\"Monitoreo - Error Handler\"**.",
        "height": 504,
        "width": 780,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "overviewNote",
      "name": "📝 Qué hace este workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        -560
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "triggerAtHour": 9
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "trigger",
      "name": "Disparador diario",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        -80,
        16
      ],
      "notes": "Corre todos los días a las 9:00 (hora del servidor/timezone del workflow)."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "1",
              "name": "workflow_name",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $workflow.name }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "2",
              "name": "event_type",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "daily_check"
            },
            {
              "id": "3",
              "name": "status",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "success"
            },
            {
              "id": "4",
              "name": "customer_email",
              "type": "string",
              "value": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "5",
              "name": "entity_id",
              "type": "string",
              "value": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "setDailyCheck",
      "name": "Preparar log: Chequeo diario",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        192,
        16
      ],
      "notes": "Arma el evento 'daily_check' (sin email ni entity_id, es a nivel del workflow entero). Confirma que el cron corrió hoy, haya o no clientes para reactivar."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "workflowId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "R4v2eOi69VpEtte0",
          "cachedResultName": "Monitoreo - Error Handler"
        },
        "mode": "each",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "execDailyCheck",
      "name": "Registrar: Chequeo diario",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        432,
        16
      ],
      "notes": "Llama al workflow central de logging. Confirma que el cron corrió, haya o no clientes para reactivar."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "SELECT id, email, first_name, last_name\nFROM customers\nWHERE (last_purchase_at IS NULL OR last_purchase_at < NOW() - INTERVAL '90 days')\n  AND reactivation_sent_at IS NULL\n  AND marketing_opt_in = true",
        "options": {
          "queryBatching": "independently"
        }
      },
      "id": "findInactive",
      "name": "Buscar clientes inactivos (90 días)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.6,
      "position": [
        672,
        16
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "id": "nnOMYtF34tQYfTC2",
          "name": "Postgres account"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Usa columnas reales de Supabase. Filtra por marketing_opt_in = true para respetar el consentimiento de marketing."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "contact",
        "operation": "upsert",
        "email": "={{ $json.email }}",
        "upsertAttributes": {
          "upsertAttributesValues": [
            {
              "fieldName": "NOMBRE",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $json.first_name }}"
            },
            {
              "fieldName": "APELLIDOS",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $json.last_name }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "requestOptions": {}
      },
      "id": "updateBrevoSegment",
      "name": "Actualizar segmento Brevo",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.sendInBlue",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        912,
        16
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "sendInBlueApi": {
          "id": "7P242ip6wmwOs29A",
          "name": "Brevo account"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Create or Update: no falla si el contacto ya existe en Brevo."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "sendTemplate",
        "templateId": 2,
        "receipients": "={{ $('Buscar clientes inactivos (90 días)').item.json.email }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "templateParameters": {
            "parameterValues": {
              "parameters": "=first_name = {{ $('Buscar clientes inactivos (90 días)').item.json.first_name }}"
            }
          }
        },
        "requestOptions": {}
      },
      "id": "sendCampaign",
      "name": "Enviar campaña de reactivación",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.sendInBlue",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1152,
        16
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "sendInBlueApi": {
          "id": "7P242ip6wmwOs29A",
          "name": "Brevo account"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Completar templateId con la plantilla de reactivación en Brevo."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "UPDATE public.customers\nSET reactivation_sent_at = NOW()\nWHERE id = $1\nRETURNING id, email, reactivation_sent_at;",
        "options": {
          "queryBatching": "independently",
          "queryReplacement": "={{ $('Buscar clientes inactivos (90 días)').item.json.id }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "markSent",
      "name": "Marcar como enviado",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.6,
      "position": [
        1392,
        16
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "id": "nnOMYtF34tQYfTC2",
          "name": "Postgres account"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Marca reactivation_sent_at por id de cliente para que nunca vuelva a recibir la campaña (envío único)."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "contact",
        "operation": "upsert",
        "email": "={{ $('Buscar clientes inactivos (90 días)').item.json.email }}",
        "upsertAttributes": {
          "upsertAttributesValues": [
            {
              "fieldName": "FUNNEL_STAGE",
              "fieldValue": "winback_sent"
            }
          ]
        },
        "requestOptions": {}
      },
      "id": "setWinbackStage",
      "name": "Actualizar FUNNEL_STAGE en Brevo",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.sendInBlue",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1632,
        16
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "sendInBlueApi": {
          "id": "7P242ip6wmwOs29A",
          "name": "Brevo account"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Guarda que a este cliente ya se le mandó la campaña de reactivación (winback_sent). Post-Purchase usa este valor para detectar clientes reactivados."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "1",
              "name": "workflow_name",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $workflow.name }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "2",
              "name": "event_type",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "reactivation_sent"
            },
            {
              "id": "3",
